  Read: Rule 110 is useful only as a generated-language warning; the live
  carrier is the miss-zeta product word plus transfer-tax labels.

SYNTHESIS
  Actual contexts are generated by a 64-state OR/deletion automaton.
  In miss-zeta coordinates, the pointwise context word factors as a
  product over clusters before x-averaging.
  The S62 residual-coordinate counterexamples do not produce failures
  against the coherent generated contexts scanned here; the x-correlated
  word is stronger than the averaged profile dot averaged capacity gap.
  No LRC14 proof is claimed; HYP-2698 sharpens the cone coordinates.
